{
  "end · card · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "Every placement spends tiles; the COST stat is the next one’s price. The price only rises; it never comes back down. It is the clock that ends every run. You may place while ANY tiles remain. The difference is forgiven at zero, and it cannot chain: only a pop lifts you back above zero.",
