  "luck · card · TUNING · daylight": "LUCK is a purse, not a score. Every pop pays a little of it, and the row under your hand spends it: a fresh draw, a colour called, a rare tile forged. Every button under your hand is priced in luck, and you CAN lose it all: the run’s end pays back only 5% of whatever is left, so a full purse you die on is mostly gone. Spend it.",
