exports[`the teaching pins — every word, exactly as it reads today · en > pins POP, THE EXPEDITION and CARAVAN: names, terms, lessons, cards, figures and rows 1`] = `
{
  "caravan · card · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "Now and then the CARAVAN comes to town wanting a pocket of one size, small or big, and it never says which. While it is IN TOWN, pop a pocket of three or more. If it fits, the caravan takes it and you choose one of three wares, each good for the rest of the run. The line under the header says when it is IN TOWN: that is the moment to try a pop.",
  "caravan · card · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "Now and then the CARAVAN comes to town wanting a pocket of one size, small or big, and it never says which. While it is IN TOWN, pop a pocket of three or more. If it fits, the caravan takes it and you choose one of three wares, each good for the rest of the run. The line under the header says when it is IN TOWN: that is the moment to try a pop.",
  "caravan · card · TUNING · daylight": "Now and then the CARAVAN comes to town wanting a pocket of one size, small or big, and it never says which. While it is IN TOWN, pop a pocket of three or more. If it fits, the caravan takes it and you choose one of three wares, each good for the rest of the run. The line under the header says when it is IN TOWN: that is the moment to try a pop.",
  "caravan · card · TUNING · settlement": "Now and then the CARAVAN comes to town wanting a pocket of one size, small or big, and it never says which. While it is IN TOWN, pop a pocket of three or more. If it fits, the caravan takes it and you choose one of three wares, each good for the rest of the run. The line under the header says when it is IN TOWN: that is the moment to try a pop.",
