  "firstPop": "YOUR FIRST POP
The pocket turned to STONE. It still surrounds, but never matches. Ground you have cashed grows poorer; the world stays rich farther out.",
  "pop · card · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
