  "pop · lesson · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
  "pop · lesson · TUNING · daylight": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
  "pop · lesson · TUNING · settlement": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
  "pop · name": "POP",
  "pop · row · reach · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "REACH | REACH is how far from home you have built. Every 4 hexes out raises the distance multiplier by 1, so the same pocket scores more the deeper it pops. | ",
  "pop · row · reach · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "REACH | REACH is how far from home you have built. Every 4 hexes out raises the distance multiplier by 1, so the same pocket scores more the deeper it pops. | ",
