  "pop · row · sizeBonus · TUNING · daylight": "SIZE BONUS | The SIZE BONUS is one point of multiplier per tile in a pocket, up to 20. Past that a bigger pocket still pays more worth, but no more multiplier. | ",
  "pop · row · sizeBonus · TUNING · settlement": "SIZE BONUS | The SIZE BONUS is one point of multiplier per tile in a pocket, up to 20. Past that a bigger pocket still pays more worth, but no more multiplier. | ",
