exports[`the teaching pins — every word, exactly as it reads today · en > pins THE MAP: its core, its card, and each row with its words and lines 1`] = `
{
  "card · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground. Every destination pays the moment a placed tile touches it.",
  "card · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground. Every destination pays the moment a placed tile touches it.",
  "card · TUNING · daylight": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground. Every destination pays the moment a placed tile touches it.",
  "card · TUNING · settlement": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground. Every destination pays the moment a placed tile touches it.",
  "map · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground.",
  "map · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "The world remembers. Ground you have walked stays on the map between runs, dimmed under the fog, and unclaimed destinations glow through it. Tap remembered fog to light its ground.",
