  "name": "THE MAP",
  "row · cache · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "CACHE | A CACHE pays 12 tiles on the spot, the moment you build a tile touching it. Caches re-arm every run, so ground you already know stays worth walking to.",
  "row · cache · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "CACHE | A CACHE pays 12 tiles on the spot, the moment you build a tile touching it. Caches re-arm every run, so ground you already know stays worth walking to.",
  "row · cache · TUNING · daylight": "CACHE | A CACHE pays 6 tiles on the spot, +4 per ring out, the moment you build a tile touching it. Caches re-arm every run, so ground you already know stays worth walking to.",
  "row · cache · TUNING · settlement": "CACHE | A CACHE pays 6 tiles on the spot, +4 per ring out, the moment you build a tile touching it. Caches re-arm every run, so ground you already know stays worth walking to.",
  "row · find · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "FIND | A FIND is buried treasure. Touch it with a tile and it gives you a PERK, yours for good in this world. Finds do not come back, and each one grants only something you do not already carry.",
  "row · find · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "FIND | A FIND is buried treasure. Touch it with a tile and it gives you a PERK, yours for good in this world. Finds do not come back, and each one grants only something you do not already carry.",
  "row · find · TUNING · daylight": "FIND | A FIND is buried treasure. Touch it with a tile and it gives you a PERK, yours for good in this world. Finds do not come back, and each one grants only something you do not already carry.",
  "row · find · TUNING · settlement": "FIND | A FIND is buried treasure. Touch it with a tile and it gives you a PERK, yours for good in this world. Finds do not come back, and each one grants only something you do not already carry.",
  "row · lens · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "THE LENS | The magnifier button beside LUCK opens the lens: one row per ground, with how many of its tiles are standing, what they are worth, and how much of it is ripe. | Tap a row to hold the lens on that ground. The board lights it, and the panel shows its power and stats; THE PRICE tab shows how its best pocket would score if you popped it now. Tap the row again to let go. | Tap any line in a table to read what it means. Pressing and holding a tile in your hand lights its ground the same way.",
  "row · lens · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "THE LENS | The magnifier button beside LUCK opens the lens: one row per ground, with how many of its tiles are standing, what they are worth, and how much of it is ripe. | Tap a row to hold the lens on that ground. The board lights it, and the panel shows its power and stats; THE PRICE tab shows how its best pocket would score if you popped it now. Tap the row again to let go. | Tap any line in a table to read what it means. Pressing and holding a tile in your hand lights its ground the same way.",
