  "row · lens · TUNING · settlement": "THE LENS | The magnifier button beside LUCK opens the lens: one row per ground, with how many of its tiles are standing, what they are worth, and how much of it is ripe. | Tap a row to hold the lens on that ground. The board lights it, and the panel shows its power and stats; THE PRICE tab shows how its best pocket would score if you popped it now. Tap the row again to let go. | Tap any line in a table to read what it means. Pressing and holding a tile in your hand lights its ground the same way.",
  "row · shrine · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "SHRINE | A SHRINE switches a system on for your world, permanently, the moment you claim it. Once every shrine unlock is woken, the next one offers a crossing to a new world instead.",
  "row · shrine · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "SHRINE | A SHRINE switches a system on for your world, permanently, the moment you claim it. Once every shrine unlock is woken, the next one offers a crossing to a new world instead.",
  "row · shrine · TUNING · daylight": "SHRINE | A SHRINE switches a system on for your world, permanently, the moment you claim it. Once every shrine unlock is woken, the next one offers a crossing to a new world instead.",
  "row · shrine · TUNING · settlement": "SHRINE | A SHRINE switches a system on for your world, permanently, the moment you claim it. Once every shrine unlock is woken, the next one offers a crossing to a new world instead.",
  "row · site · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "SITE | A SITE is claimed by building a tile touching it. It pays 25 points × its distance from home, and it opens a BOUNTY. Sites re-arm every run, so a claimed one is worth returning to. | A BOUNTY is a site’s second payout: it opens when you claim the site. To collect it, pop 0+ tiles within 6 hexes of the site’s star, taking POINTS (not tiles): that pop scores ×3. Only one bounty at a time; another site opens no second one while this one waits.",
  "row · site · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "SITE | A SITE is claimed by building a tile touching it. It pays 25 points × its distance from home, and it opens a BOUNTY. Sites re-arm every run, so a claimed one is worth returning to. | A BOUNTY is a site’s second payout: it opens when you claim the site. To collect it, pop 0+ tiles within 6 hexes of the site’s star, taking POINTS (not tiles): that pop scores ×3. Only one bounty at a time; another site opens no second one while this one waits.",
  "row · site · TUNING · daylight": "SITE | A SITE is claimed by building a tile touching it. It pays 25 points × its distance from home, and it opens a BOUNTY. Sites re-arm every run, so a claimed one is worth returning to. | A BOUNTY is a site’s second payout: it opens when you claim the site. To collect it, pop 8+ tiles within 12 hexes of the site’s star, taking POINTS (not tiles): that pop scores ×3. Only one bounty at a time; another site opens no second one while this one waits.",
  "row · site · TUNING · settlement": "SITE | A SITE is claimed by building a tile touching it. It pays 25 points × its distance from home, and it opens a BOUNTY. Sites re-arm every run, so a claimed one is worth returning to. | A BOUNTY is a site’s second payout: it opens when you claim the site. To collect it, pop 8+ tiles within 12 hexes of the site’s star, taking POINTS (not tiles): that pop scores ×3. Only one bounty at a time; another site opens no second one while this one waits.",
  "row · territory · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "TERRITORY | A TERRITORY claims the ground within 2 hexes as native to its colour, for good. | Ground a TERRITORY holds is native to its colour: a tile of that colour placed there is worth one more.",
  "row · territory · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "TERRITORY | A TERRITORY claims the ground within 2 hexes as native to its colour, for good. | Ground a TERRITORY holds is native to its colour: a tile of that colour placed there is worth one more.",
  "row · territory · TUNING · daylight": "TERRITORY | A TERRITORY claims the ground within 2 hexes as native to its colour, for good. Each one held starts your later runs with +6 tiles, up to +24. | Ground a TERRITORY holds is native to its colour: a tile of that colour placed there is worth one more.",
  "row · territory · TUNING · settlement": "TERRITORY | A TERRITORY claims the ground within 2 hexes as native to its colour, for good. Each one held starts your later runs with +6 tiles, up to +24. | Ground a TERRITORY holds is native to its colour: a tile of that colour placed there is worth one more.",
