  "luck · TUNING · settlement": "LUCK is a purse, not a score. Every pop pays a little of it, and the row under your hand spends it: a fresh draw, a colour called, a rare tile forged.",
  "pop · BARE_TUNING · daylight": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
  "pop · BARE_TUNING · settlement": "POP cashes a ripe pocket. It pays tiles to keep you placing, and points as your score. Waiting grows the pocket and pays more, but every placement still costs tiles, so waiting too long can end a run before it pops. Small and often buys LUCK and steers your draws. Big and late buys tiles and score.",
