  "lesson · green · BARE_TUNING · daylight": null,
  "lesson · green · BARE_TUNING · settlement": null,
  "lesson · green · TUNING · daylight": "FARM. Wants one big mob of its own colour: +0.7 worth per FARM neighbour past the first.",
  "lesson · green · TUNING · settlement": "FARM. Wants one big mob of its own colour: +0.7 worth per FARM neighbour past the first.",
  "lesson · red · BARE_TUNING · daylight": null,
